<title>ITALY: Benetton to buy 57 pct of Sportsystem.</title>
<headline>Benetton to buy 57 pct of Sportsystem.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian clothing giant Benetton on Tuesday said it would buy immediately a 57 percent stake in Benetton Sportsystem from the Benetton family holding company Edizione Holding for 318 billion lire.</p>
<p>Benetton added in a statement after a decision by its board that it will make an offer for the remaining 43 percent of Benetton Sportsystem by March 31, 1998 with the payment of a further 249 billion lire.</p>
</text>
